      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.099,
          "end": 2.719,
          "en": "Another limitation of these models",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.059,
          "end": 5.579,
          "en": "is, of course, that they were",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.599,
          "end": 8.5,
          "en": "trained based on data that has a certain",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.939,
          "end": 11.8,
          "en": "knowledge cutoff. When the training",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.819,
          "end": 14.559,
          "en": "process starts, you can't feed more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.659,
          "end": 17.419,
          "en": "data into it when it's currently training,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.619,
          "end": 20.34,
          "en": "in the end. So, let's say you're training a new",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.359,
          "end": 23.1,
          "en": "foundation model and you wanna start next month.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.439,
          "end": 26.42,
          "en": "Then, you're going to use all the text you can get from the internet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.959,
          "end": 29.459,
          "en": "up to this month. Whatever happens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.479,
          "end": 32.24,
          "en": "thereafter is not something that makes it into the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.319,
          "end": 35.18,
          "en": "training process. And that means that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.239,
          "end": 37.78,
          "en": "if you're asking a model for something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.879,
          "end": 40.639,
          "en": "recent, if you're asking it, \"Hey, what's the latest",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.719,
          "end": 43.479,
          "en": "AI model released by OpenAI?\" it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.52,
          "end": 46.44,
          "en": "can't know that because that happened after",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.459,
          "end": 49.159,
          "en": "its knowledge cutoff. It can predict",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.779,
          "end": 52.519,
          "en": "likely tokens, and it will therefore likely",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.659,
          "end": 54.759,
          "en": "end up with a hallucination.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.299,
          "end": 58.059,
          "en": "Or it will not, actually, because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.099,
          "end": 60.479,
          "en": "this knowledge cutoff problem, and the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.899,
          "end": 63.86,
          "en": "problem with asking for recent information, is a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.919,
          "end": 66.419,
          "en": "well-known problem. And there are two main",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.5,
          "end": 69.239,
          "en": "solutions for it. One solution is, of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.26,
          "end": 72.059,
          "en": "course, to, again, train the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.119,
          "end": 74.88,
          "en": "model on extra conversations that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.059,
          "end": 77.719,
          "en": "do ask for recent information and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.72,
          "end": 80.059,
          "en": "train it with made-up conversations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
