          "end": 86.179,
          "en": "I don't know that. My knowledge ends at\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.699,
          "end": 89.639,
          "en": "whatever date, so that it's more likely that it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.65899999999999,
          "end": 92.339,
          "en": "will generate a response like this if it sees",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.72,
          "end": 95.279,
          "en": "questions for recent events. That's one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.339,
          "end": 98.239,
          "en": "solution, to fine-tune it to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.799,
          "end": 101.53999999999999,
          "en": "not reply or to not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.63900000000001,
          "end": 104.15899999999999,
          "en": "come up with an actual reply to such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.339,
          "end": 107.119,
          "en": "questions, just as it was trained to always be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.199,
          "end": 109.719,
          "en": "kind and so on. The",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110,
          "end": 112.919,
          "en": "better solution, of course, is to give",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.09899999999999,
          "end": 115.82,
          "en": "the model tools, or specifically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.019,
          "end": 118.739,
          "en": "to give it access to the web, because if it can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
